---
import PageIntro from "../components/PageIntro.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Cookies Policy | Jeremy Sayers"
  description="Cookies and privacy choices for JeremySayers.com."
>
  <PageIntro
    title="Cookies Policy"
    description="This page explains the browser storage used by JeremySayers.com and how to change optional analytics choices."
  />

  <section class="section-band section-band--paper">
    <div class="shell stack">
      <SectionHeading eyebrow="Last updated" title="September 7, 2026" />
      <article class="panel policy-card">
        <h2>Strictly necessary storage</h2>
        <p>
          The site stores a first-party privacy preference in your browser so it can remember whether you allowed
          optional analytics. This storage is used only to operate the privacy choice system.
        </p>

        <h2>Optional analytics</h2>
        <p>
          If you choose Analytics, the site loads Google Analytics 4. Google Analytics may set cookies whose names
          begin with <code>_ga</code> to measure aggregate traffic and page performance. The Google Analytics script is
          not downloaded before you grant permission.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising</h2>
        <p>This site does not currently use personalized advertising cookies.</p>

        <h2>Change your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can reopen your choices at any time. Turning Analytics off stops future analytics collection and removes
          known Google Analytics cookies for this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          <button class="footer-privacy-button" type="button" data-privacy-preferences>
            Cookie and Privacy Choices
          </button>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
